  "html": "<article id=\"post-6234\" class=\"container post-6234 page type-page status-publish hentry\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title\">Get $1,000 Off</h1>\t</header>\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-1\">Sign up for a maintenance agreement and get $1,000 off a future new system installation!*</h1>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As summer wraps up, 2nd Wind Heating and Air Conditioning has an unbeatable offer to keep your system running smoothly all year and keep money in your pocket when the time comes for a new heating and cooling system.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This limited-time deal ensures your HVAC system stays in top condition year-round while providing your future self with big savings!</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>*No cash value. Does not apply to any maintenance plan that renews or is eligible for renewal between August 1, 2024 and September 15, 2024 (the “Promotional Period”). Does not apply if the maintenance plan purchased during the Promotional Period expires, lapses, or is not renewed at any time prior to the installation of the new heating and cooling system. The $1,000 off may not be used prior to November 1, 2024, and may only be applied towards the installation of a new heating and cooling system that is rated 16 SEER and above and that replaces the heating and cooling system covered by the maintenance plan. Cannot be combined with any other offers.</em></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Speak with an expert</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+17575254911\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(757) 525-4911</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"text-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same day appointments available by phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container pb-5 has-primary-inverse-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-3\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div  class=\"card mt-5 p-3 border-radius-sm flow align-self-center card--wide has-white-background-color\" style=\"\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-decorator h-decorator--primary is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f36ac205 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Premium Home Care Agreement</h2>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"mt-2 wp-block-paragraph\">Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical&#8217;s maintenance plans ensure efficiency and longevity for your home&#8217;s systems, offering flexibility with standalone services or bundled options covering HVAC, Plumbing, and Electrical needs.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-3 mt-2 border-radius-xs has-gray-light-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div  class=\"iconlist\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-iconsize=\"md\">\n    <ul role=\"list\">\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-home-with-checkmark\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Emergency Service Response:</strong> Count on Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical for prompt emergency assistance, ensuring your home’s systems are back up and running in no time.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-note\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Priority Scheduling:</strong> Enjoy the convenience of priority scheduling, guaranteeing timely service appointments and efficient maintenance for your home’s major systems.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-wrench\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Regular Maintenance:</strong> Stay ahead with regular maintenance plans from Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical, ensuring optimal performance and longevity for your home&#8217;s plumbing, electric, and HVAC systems.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-price-change\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Discounts on Repairs:</strong> Save on repair costs with Russell&#8217;s maintenance plans, benefitting from discounted rates for repairs and replacements to keep your home running smoothly.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mobile-wrap-and-center align-flex-end w100 is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f36ac205 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card__price is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fba139f5 wp-b