\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>20% Discount:</strong> Save on service and diagnostic fees, ensuring cost-effective maintenance for your home generator.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-note\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>15% Discount:</strong> Enjoy reduced costs on parts and labor for generator repairs, providing value and reliability.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mobile-wrap-and-center align-flex-end w100 is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f36ac205 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card__price is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fba139f5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"text-uppercase text-upper wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h2>\n</div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+17575254911\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta position-relative\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(757) 525-4911</span>\n</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n        <div  class=\"google-reviews-featured container container py-5 has-background has-gray-light-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head no-reviews-to-display\">\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo\">            <svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"ht